========================================================================
OBJ3  flat B0c elimination; Lambda channel placement; operator inverse
========================================================================
closure equation: Eq(J, Lambda_A*(-Z*(J/rho_m + V)/rho_m + mu_s) + Lambda_V*V)
J solved = rho_m*(-Lambda_A*V*Z + Lambda_A*mu_s*rho_m + Lambda_V*V*rho_m)/(Lambda_A*Z + rho_m**2)
